{"resourceIdentifier":"2556","resourceName":"Southern Paraguay Sustainable Afforestation Project","description":"The project is located in Itaipua and Misiones and is implemented by SilviPar S.A. Silvipar currently has 1,966.67 ha of eucalyptus clones planted and distributed in four properties (Santa Bárbara, Flor Cue, Stella Maris y San Rafael) in the departments of Itapúa and Misiones, to be certified, in accordance with the Verified Carbon Standard (VCS) eligibility criteria for the Agriculture, Forestry, and Other Land Use (AFOLU) projects grouped under the category of afforestation, restoration, and revegetation (ARR).\r\nIn July 2022, this project changed its name from Silvipar S.A. forest plantations for the certification of carbon credits to Southern Paraguay Sustainable Afforestation Project and the proponent was changed from Silvipar S.A. to Saiff Hold Co. Ltd.","location":{"latitude":27.096944,"longitude":-57.981664},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2025-07-21","endExclusive":"2025-08-21","endInclusive":"2025-08-20"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2556"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Eastern region"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"SAIFF HoldCo Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Grand Cayman, Cayman Islands"},{"type":"string","value":"+1 345 749 2776"},{"type":"string","value":"rpalmer@dmsgovernance.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Verification approval requested"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2556"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2556"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"170514"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":19518}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"